+## 2. Acceptance LARP (How we prove the experience works)
+
+### 2a. Required Personas to LARP
+
+| Persona | Flow | Build artifact | Evidence required |
+|---------|------|----------------|-------------------|
+| operator | Review extracted proposals and confirm selected actions | Running review surface | Screenshot or interaction transcript showing proposal states before and after confirmation |
+
+### 2b. Acceptance Scenarios
+
+#### AC-1 — Review available proposals
+- **GIVEN** the running build contains one or more proposals produced by S001 that have not been confirmed
+- **WHEN** the operator opens the review surface
+- **THEN** the operator can see each available proposal and can distinguish it from a confirmed action
+- **AND** no proposal is represented as approved before an explicit operator confirmation
+- **EVIDENCE** `screenshots/<sha>-proposal-review.png` and an interaction transcript identifying the unconfirmed proposals
+- **VERIFIABILITY** agent-LARP
+
+#### AC-2 — Confirm a selected proposal
+- **GIVEN** the running review surface shows an unconfirmed proposal from S001
+- **WHEN** the operator explicitly confirms that proposal
+- **THEN** the proposal visibly changes to confirmed
+- **AND** the confirmed action is made available to S003 while unconfirmed proposals are not
+- **EVIDENCE** `larp-recordings/<sha>-operator-confirmation.md` showing the before/after state and the S003-visible confirmed action
+- **VERIFIABILITY** agent-LARP
+
+#### AC-3 — Keep an unconfirmed proposal out of scheduling
+- **GIVEN** the running build contains both a confirmed proposal and an unconfirmed proposal
+- **WHEN** the operator completes the review without confirming the second proposal
+- **THEN** the unconfirmed proposal remains visibly unconfirmed
+- **AND** S003 cannot treat it as a confirmed action
+- **EVIDENCE** `larp-recordings/<sha>-operator-unconfirmed-proposal.md` showing that only the confirmed proposal is available downstream
+- **VERIFIABILITY** agent-LARP
+
